// never felt mutual love, grew up from a poor family.
// Attended her aranged marriage but noticed her sworn lover never showed up, she ran away after being disappointed because she had started to like him but got jumped by bandits in her search for him.
// file: ghost_bride, speaker: Ghost Bride

// ============================================================
// IDLE — Between hands. Love metaphors, wedding references.
// ============================================================

title: GhostBride_Idle_Musing_01
tags: idle
speaker: ghost_bride
category: idle
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: idle1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] I keep smoothing the wrinkles out of this dress. Force of habit. It was supposed to be the most beautiful thing I ever wore.
//END: idle1
===

title: GhostBride_Idle_Musing_02
tags: idle
speaker: ghost_bride
category: idle
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: idle2
Ghost Bride: [auto/] You know, waiting between hands feels a lot like standing at the altar. You just keep hoping the next one shows up.
//END: idle2
===

title: GhostBride_Idle_Musing_03
tags: idle
speaker: ghost_bride
category: idle
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: idle3
Ghost Bride: [auto/] My mother used to say love finds you when you stop looking. I never stopped looking. Still hasn't found me.
//END: idle3
===

title: GhostBride_Idle_Musing_04
tags: idle
speaker: ghost_bride
category: idle
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: idle4
Ghost Bride: [auto/] There is something about shuffling cards that reminds me of how quickly fate rearranges everything.
//END: idle4
===

title: GhostBride_Idle_Musing_05
tags: idle
speaker: ghost_bride
category: idle
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: idle5
Ghost Bride: [auto/] I ran out into the dark for him. The road was so cold. This table is warmer, at least.
//END: idle5
===

title: GhostBride_Idle_Musing_06
tags: idle
speaker: ghost_bride
category: idle
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: idle6
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Sometimes I catch my reflection in the chips and I think... I look exactly the same as that night. Funny how death preserves you at your worst moment.
//END: idle6
===

