priority: 1
---
//START: casual2
Ghost Bride: [auto/] My gut says call. My gut also told me to chase a man through bandit country, so take that as you will.
//END: casual2
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_Play_03
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual3
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Committing to a bad hand is just like committing to a bad marriage. You keep paying and paying until there is nothing left.
//END: casual3
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_Play_04
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual4
Ghost Bride: [auto/] I do not calculate odds. I feel them. Right here, in the chest where my heart used to beat.
//END: casual4
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_Play_05
tags: casual
speaker: ghost_bride
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual5
Ghost Bride: [auto/] People overthink this game. Sometimes you just have to throw the veil over your eyes and leap.
//END: casual5
===

title: GhostBride_Casual_Play_06
