//END: player5
===

// ============================================================
// LORE — Her backstory.
// ============================================================

title: GhostBride_Lore_Marriage_01
tags: lore
speaker: ghost_bride
category: lore
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: lore1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] My father arranged the match. I hated it at first. But when I met the groom, I started to think maybe... maybe this could work. Then my sworn lover heard about it and promised to stop the wedding. I believed him.
//END: lore1
===

title: GhostBride_Lore_Lover_02
tags: lore
speaker: ghost_bride
category: lore
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: lore2
Ghost Bride: [auto/] He never came. The ceremony began and his seat was empty. I kept looking at the door. Every footstep, every shadow. None of them were him.
//END: lore2
===

title: GhostBride_Lore_Death_03
tags: lore
speaker: ghost_bride
category: lore
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: lore3
Ghost Bride: [auto/] I ran from the altar in this dress. Right out into the night, down roads I did not know. The bandits found me before he did. He never found me at all.
//END: lore3
===

title: GhostBride_Lore_Dress_04
tags: lore
speaker: ghost_bride
category: lore
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: lore4
Ghost Bride: [auto/] This dress was supposed to mean the start of something. Now it is just what I was wearing when everything ended. I cannot take it off. Believe me, I have tried.
//END: lore4
===

// ============================================================
