// ============================================================

title: GhostBride_Pair_BeautyXu_01
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: beauty_xu
phase: any
requires: $beauty_xu
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_xu1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Xu, you and I are proof that being beautiful in this world is just an invitation for cruelty.
//END: pair_xu1
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_BeautyXu_02
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: beauty_xu
phase: any
requires: $beauty_xu
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_xu2
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Stop folding every time someone raises at you, Xu. You spent your whole life bowing your head. You do not have to do that anymore.
//END: pair_xu2
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_BeautyXu_03
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: beauty_xu
phase: any
requires: $beauty_xu
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_xu3
Ghost Bride: [auto/] If anyone at this table gives you trouble, Xu, I will haunt them so hard they will wish they were alive again just so they could die from the fright.
//END: pair_xu3
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_BeautyXu_04
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: beauty_xu
phase: between_hands
requires: $beauty_xu
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_xu4
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Your music lessons, my wedding preparations. We both spent our last living days doing something hopeful. That is the cruelest part.
//END: pair_xu4
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_BeautyXu_05
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: beauty_xu
phase: any
requires: $beauty_xu
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_xu5
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Xu, I see how you flinch when someone moves too fast. I do the same thing. But here it is just cards. Nobody can hurt us with cards.
//END: pair_xu5
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_BeautyXu_06
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: beauty_xu
phase: any
requires: $beauty_xu
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_xu6
Ghost Bride: [auto/] You keep telling me to find peace, Xu. I do not want peace. I want to feel something real. Even anger is better than nothing.
//END: pair_xu6
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_BeautyXu_07
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: beauty_xu
phase: showdown
requires: $beauty_xu
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_xu7
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Look at that, Xu! We are still here, still playing. They took our lives but they could not take the fight out of us.
//END: pair_xu7
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_BeautyXu_08
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: beauty_xu
phase: between_hands
requires: $beauty_xu
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_xu8
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Xu, if we had known each other in life, I would have walked you home every night. No alley would have been dark enough to scare me off.
//END: pair_xu8
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_BeautyXu_09
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: beauty_xu
phase: any
requires: $beauty_xu
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_xu9
Ghost Bride: [auto/] You are too gentle for this table, Xu. But do not mistake gentle for weak. I have seen you play. You are sharper than anyone expects.
//END: pair_xu9
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_BeautyXu_10
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: beauty_xu
phase: any
requires: $beauty_xu
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_xu10
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Promise me something, Xu. Next time you have a strong hand, do not apologize for playing it. You deserve to win as much as anyone here.
//END: pair_xu10
===

// ============================================================
