//END: pair_cai1
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_EunuchCai_02
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: eunuch_cai
phase: any
requires: $eunuch_cai
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_cai2
