//END: pair_cai2
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_EunuchCai_03
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: eunuch_cai
phase: between_hands
requires: $eunuch_cai
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_cai3
Ghost Bride: [auto/] You took the blame for a crime that was not yours. I ran after a man who was not worth it. We are both fools who gave too much to people who gave nothing back.
//END: pair_cai3
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_EunuchCai_04
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: eunuch_cai
phase: any
requires: $eunuch_cai
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_cai4
Ghost Bride: [auto/] I know I am loud, Cai. I know I push too hard. But someone has to push you, because you will not push yourself.
//END: pair_cai4
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_EunuchCai_05
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: eunuch_cai
phase: any
requires: $eunuch_cai
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_cai5
Ghost Bride: [auto/] You flinch every time you raise, like you are asking permission. Cai, the only person who needs to approve your bet is you.
//END: pair_cai5
===

