//END: pair_niu1
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_GeneralTian_01
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: general_tian
phase: any
requires: $general_tian
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_tian1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] A woman who commanded armies and answered to no one. General Tian, you lived the life I did not even know I was allowed to want.
//END: pair_tian1
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_Guard_01
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: guard
phase: any
requires: $guard
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_guard1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Save the gallant act, Guard. I have heard enough honeyed promises from men to last two lifetimes. Yours ring the most hollow of all.
//END: pair_guard1
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_LordXie_01
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: lord_xie
phase: any
requires: $lord_xie
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_xie1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Lord Xie, men like you decided my fate in a parlor over tea. Arranged my whole life like furniture. Forgive me if I do not bow.
//END: pair_xie1
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_MadamSong_01
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: madam_song
phase: any
requires: $madam_song
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_song1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] You built an empire in a world that wanted you silent, Madam Song. I am wary of your methods, but I cannot deny I admire the result.
//END: pair_song1
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_MrLi_01
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: mr_li
phase: any
requires: $mr_li
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_li1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] You count every chip like it is your last breath, Li. That greed in your eyes... I saw it once before, on a dark road, in much worse company.
//END: pair_li1
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_MrZhu_01
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: mr_zhu
phase: any
requires: $mr_zhu
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_zhu1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Falsely accused and killed for it. I know how that feels, Zhu. Fate decided we were guilty of something we never did and punished us anyway.
//END: pair_zhu1
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_Poet_01
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: poet
phase: any
requires: $poet
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_poet1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Your loneliness has a shape to it, Poet. I can see it from here. Mine looks the same, just dressed in white silk instead of verses.
//END: pair_poet1
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_Rogue_01
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: rogue
phase: any
requires: $rogue
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_rogue1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Fierce and kind. That is a rare pairing, Rogue. I could have used someone like you on that road. Where were you when the bandits came?
//END: pair_rogue1
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_Shaman_01
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: shaman
phase: any
requires: $shaman
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_shaman1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Your calm unsettles me, Shaman. How can you sit so still when the world took everything from you too? Teach me that, or stop doing it.
//END: pair_shaman1
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_Wanderer_01
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: wanderer
phase: any
requires: $wanderer
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_wanderer1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] You could just leave when things got bad. Pack up and walk away. I envy that. I was always tethered to someone else's plan.
//END: pair_wanderer1
===

title: GhostBride_Pair_YusenZhou_01
tags: pair
speaker: ghost_bride
category: pair
target: yusen_zhou
phase: any
requires: $yusen_zhou
priority: 3
---
//START: pair_yusen1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] You died protecting something you loved, Yusen. That kind of fierce loyalty... that is all I ever wanted in a partner. Where were people like you when I was alive?
//END: pair_yusen1
===

// ============================================================
// TRIO — Captured Souls (Ghost Bride + Beauty Xu + Poet)
// ============================================================

title: GhostBride_Trio_CapturedSouls_01
tags: trio
speaker: ghost_bride
category: trio
target: any
phase: any
requires: $beauty_xu and $poet
priority: 4
---
//START: trio1
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Look at the three of us. A bride, a musician, and a poet. We were wanted for what we looked like, what we sounded like, what we could be kept as. Not for who we were. Not once.
//END: trio1
===

title: GhostBride_Trio_CapturedSouls_02
tags: trio
speaker: ghost_bride
category: trio
target: any
phase: between_hands
requires: $beauty_xu and $poet
priority: 4
---
//START: trio2
Ghost Bride: [auto/] Xu was stalked. Poet was caged. I was sold to a man I had never met. They wanted to own us. But here at this table, we own ourselves. Every chip, every choice. Ours.
//END: trio2
===

